{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "chess-studio",
    "health",
    "sre",
    "terraform",
    "${commit_sha}"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Chess Studio · Salud operativa",
  "uid": "chess-studio-api-overview",
  "version": 3,
  "weekStart": "monday",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "backend_service",
        "label": "Backend",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "chess-studio-backend,chess-studio-backend-staging",
        "current": {
          "text": "chess-studio-backend",
          "value": "chess-studio-backend"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "chess-studio-backend.*",
        "multi": false,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Operación",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Estado a primera vista.** Un `0` significa que la consulta respondió correctamente pero no hubo eventos en esa ventana; `No data` queda reservado para paneles donde la ausencia es semántica (logs/trazas) o para una señal que necesita diagnóstico. Si algo sale mal, abre **Chess Studio · Logs accionables** para 404/5xx/request_id y **Chess Studio · Trazas** para seguir latencia extremo a extremo. Deploy `${commit_sha}`."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "P0 · OCI · coste mes",
      "description": "Coste real acumulado del mes consultado en OCI Usage API. La cifra puede llevar retraso de ingestión del proveedor; SIN DATOS durante >12 h es un fallo de observabilidad y debe investigarse.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "last_over_time(chess_studio_billing_cost_current_cycle{provider=\"oci\"}[12h])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{currency}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "P0 · Cloudflare · coste variable ciclo",
      "description": "Coste usage-based acumulado del ciclo desde Cloudflare Billing. No incluye cuotas fijas de planes/suscripciones. SIN DATOS durante >12 h es un fallo de observabilidad y debe investigarse.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "last_over_time(chess_studio_billing_cost_current_cycle{provider=\"cloudflare\"}[12h])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{currency}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "5xx · 15 min",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chess_studio_http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\",http_response_status_class=\"5xx\"}[15m])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "404 · 1 h",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\"} | json | event=\"http_request\" | status = 404 [1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "p95 API · 15 min",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "(1000 * histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(chess_studio_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\"}[15m])))) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Requests · 15 min",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chess_studio_http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\"}[15m])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "HTTP por status",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_class) (rate(chess_studio_http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "p95 por ruta",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(8, 1000 * histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(chess_studio_http_server_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])))) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "5xx recientes",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"${backend_service:regex}\"} | json | event=\"http_request\" | status >= 500 | line_format \"{{.status}} {{.method}} {{.route}} · {{.duration_ms}}ms · req={{.request_id}} · trace={{.trace_id}}\"",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Trazas recientes · Tempo",
      "type": "traces",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "${traces_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "${traces_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"${backend_service:regex}\" }",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "refId": "A",
          "limit": 50
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    }
  ]
}
